<section id="scheduling" class="section-alt py-5"><div class="container"><h2>Scheduling your pickup</h2><p>After placing your order, open your customer account to enter your date leaving campus and pickup details. You can add or update your schedule later.</p><p>You can change your pickup day or time up to 48 hours before your original scheduled time. For assistance, call <a href="tel:3365495216">336.549.5216</a>.</p></div></section>